      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This still happens with build 2024.3.1-1489-f81475ed8d-Release in Space and Chill. Setting the mode to dynamic doesn't make the near plane near enough. Setting the mode to forced is an instant crash.\n\nThis is the last thing logged:\n\n2024.08.14 04:06:43 Log        -  [Settings] Near clip override mode set to: Forced\n\n2024.08.14 04:06:43 Warning    -  The far clipping plane has been clamped for camera 'Camera (eye)' because the Umbra module is in-use in the current scene. To avoid precision issues, the Umbra module requires near and far clipping planes to be no further apart than 6 magnitudes. If you want to disable Umbra for this scene and remove this limitation, clear any baked occlusion data.\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_ddc67c04-b09c-4e3b-b470-bf79e3caeb7a",
